J T 1~
guardian thief cook~
the humungous cook~
An absolutely enormous cook taste-tests a sauce over in the far corner of the kitchen.
~
   An absolutely huge man curls over a small pot and smells the rising steam
before dipping a small spoon in the pot's contents.  He is about the size of an
orc, although he is obviously human, and just as fat as he is tall.  His
bulbous and bald head is covered in sweat that collects and drips down his head
and neck onto his cook's uniform.  He has huge, bugging blue eyes and a round,
large nose, and his mouth is hidden behind rather large cheeks and the several
double chins under his small, real chin.  A slight brown mustache curls neatly
under his nose, and various dried sauce bits suspend from it.  His white
uniform and apron wraps tightly around his large frame, and is sparklingly
clean, oddly enough.  His left forearm bears a large tattoo of a gorgeous
looking female face, with a banner inscribed just under the face that reads,
'Ella.  ' He bears a fresh red rose in his left breast pocket.    
~
