H T 0~
wizened queen thieves thief guildmaster woman~
the wizened Queen of Thieves~
A wizened woman stands before several rogues, demonstrating the art of the quickhanded.
~
   The most notable features of this comely lady are her hands.  They are
constantly in graceful, lightning quick motion, grabbing coins from onlookers
purses while gently conversing with them, tapping others on their shoulders
only to reveal a piece of clothing stolen in the distraction, and hundreds of
other deft maneuverings.  Her violently red hair cascades midway down her back
in a fall of vicious curls, all bound by a black leather thong.  She is dressed
conservatively in earthtone leather attire, tailored specifically to her thin,
well proportioned figure.  Always performing, teaching, and demonstrating quick
handiwork, her soft voice lifts passed all onlookers, giving advise, jeering
failures, and praising successes.  In the many, many years she has trained
other rogues the talent of the quickhanded, she has been challenged constantly
by the ambitious and foolish.  As is obvious to all, her skills far outclass
any rogue in history.    
~
