for a gnome.  Great white wisps of hair fly out in erratic directions from the
top of his head.  Spectacles slightly askew rest atop a bulbous nose, lending
to an air of ridiculous fervor.  Indeed, the gnome is intently studying one of
the spyglasses, and seems to notice nothing else that is going on around him.
He murmers to himself constantly.    
~
