H T 0~
waiter m38805~
a smooth, quick waiter~
A waiter smoothly makes his way through the jostle with a large silver platter.
~
   Impeccably clean is what describes this waiter best.  Groomed, sleek black
hair slicked back frames a slender, darkly tanned face.  The waiter wears a
spotless black uniform, and a large, steaming towel adorns his left arm.  His
right arm holds a large silver platter suspended above his shoulder.  The
platter, richly dressed with every imaginable dish of succulent fare, bends
under the weight of the food, shifting slightly as the waiter makes sudden
turns around tables.  However, the waiter never once spills a sauce or drink,
even when ignorant patrons jostle him or bump into him.    
~
