H T 0~
thug grunt olga~
&05Olga&00, the Warehouse Thug~
&05Olga&00, the enormous warehouse thug, stands on guard here.
~
   Olga is one of the largest human women in this era.  She stands nearly 3
meters tall, and her limbs are as thick as oaken trunks.  Her trunk is
well-muscled, without an ounce of fat, and yet she is broader than most
minotaurs.  Her extremely uncomely face is bent into a permanent grimace.  
What could be called brown hair has been swept back tightly into a military
bun, stretching the skin around the edge of her face, accentuating the grimace
she continuously holds.  He arms and thick, calloused hands are constantly in a
crossed pattern, except when she tugs the occasional rogue through the tile
above her.  She does not look happy, but looks content, roughly enjoying the
gruntwork she has been assigned to.    
~
