H T 0~
politicians masked~
the masked group of bickering politicians~
A large group of politicians in masks bicker on the latest forms of worldwide extortion.
~
   Nothing can calm the storm created in the disputes of these politicians.  
Finely garbed in their city's political garb, each representative has donned a
white, featureless mask for anonymity.  They bicker, shout, rage, and in the
end settle issues revolving around taxation, extortion, lawmaking, and every
aspect of governmental fraud.  Indeed, though in the public view these
representatives are spotlessly classy individuals, here their true nature has
reared its head.  Any spectator can imagine what immense wealth, power, and
amounts of magical artifacts this group alone has swindled into the warehouse.
  
~
