H T 0~
beggar rogue thief~
the beggar rogue~
A decrepit and emaciated beggar looks with a dulled look at your coinpurse.
~
   Dirty rags barely cling to the skeleton form of this horridly emaciated
beggar.  His face is caked with old blood, pus, and mud, and he seems able to
shift only slightly in movement.  Every several moments, wheezing can be heard
escaping his throat as he pleads breathlessly at some passerby for a spare
coin.  However, when the occasional passerby does give him a coin, he develops
a broad grin, jumps up, and his emaciated form seems to fill into that of a
healthy middle aged man, who pockets the coin.  Shortly thereafter, the man
disguises himself as a beggar and continues his practice.    
~
