~
   The rogue merchant eyes you once and sputters, "Quicklike, now, okay?  " and
promptly reveals a box.  Upon opening the box, one can easily see that it has
been cantripped to fit even large objects inside it without affecting the
weight of the box.  The man holding it is slightly dirtly, with rotten teeth
and a dirty coat and cap.  His wiry and oily hair spring out of the cap.  In
all directions.  His knobby nose is scar ridden, as is his chin.  His hands are
concealed beneath pristine black gloves, however, in sharp contrast with the
rest of his drab, dirty clothing.    
~
