X T 0~
elzix shadow lord~
Elzix~
A slender drow melds into the shadows of the room.
~
   Elzix is a slender built drow that appears to be aging quite gracefully.  
He moves with a graceful walk, but an injury to his right hand has left him
slightly handicapped.  Definitely, not an injury that could support a thief of
any less notoriety.  Because of the respect the Council holds for Elzix, he has
been given the position of keeping the guilds inventory of loot and even
handing out jobs to passing guild members.  It has been whispered that Elzix
has the tendency to be a scoundrel, even amongst his fellow guild members.  
However, fear of his powerful political influence has kept most Council members
at bay.    
~
